{"seq":2,"slug":"counters","title":"计数器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/crdt-conflict-free-types/state-based/counters","wordCount":1507,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"计数器\">计数器</h1><p>一个被几十个 Web 节点并发自增的「点赞数」，看似最简单的需求，却是分布式系统里最经典的丢更新现场：两个节点同时读到 100，各自加一写回 101，本该是 102 的计数永远少了一。计数器 CRDT 用一个朴素到近乎狡猾的办法解决它——不要去合并「102」这个结果，而是让每个副本只记自己贡献了多少，合并时按来源相加。这一篇把这套思路从只增的 G-Counter 推到可增可减的 PN-Counter，它们是 <a href=\"cvrdt-semilattice\">状态 CRDT 与半格</a> 里那台半格机器最干净的非平凡实例。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>丢更新</strong>：两个节点同时读到 100、各自加一写回 101，本该是 102 的计数永远少了一——这是「合并结果」思路的经典事故。</li>\n<li><strong>分量式计数</strong>：不维护一个会被并发覆盖的全局计数，而是让每个副本各持一个「自己加了多少」的分量向量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span>，查询值取 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>k</mi></msub><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum_k P[k]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0497em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1864em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li><strong>G-Counter</strong>：状态是长度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 的非负整数向量，副本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 只动自己的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P[i]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>；合并为<strong>逐分量取 max</strong>。用 max 而非相加，是因为每个分量记的是该副本的累计贡献、单调上升，取 max 才能保证幂等。</li>\n<li><strong>PN-Counter</strong>：用两个 G-Counter（加向量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span> 与减向量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span>）相减来支持减法。减法被翻译成「另一方向向量增大」，单调性失而复得。</li>\n<li><strong>半格对应</strong>：G-Counter 是「自然数向量逐分量 max 半格」的实例；PN-Counter 是两个该半格的<strong>乘积半格</strong>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"g-counter-只增计数器\">G-Counter：只增计数器</h2><p>G-Counter（Grow-only Counter）的核心洞察是：与其维护一个会被并发覆盖的全局计数，不如让每个副本各持一个「自己加了多少」的分量。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 个副本，状态就是一个长度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 的非负整数向量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span>，副本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 自增只动自己的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P[i]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>更新</strong>：副本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 执行 <code>increment()</code>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>←</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P[i] \\leftarrow P[i] + 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">←</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>。只碰自己的分量，绝不触碰别人的，所以并发自增互不干扰。</li>\n<li><strong>查询值</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>value</mtext><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>k</mi></msub><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{value} = \\sum_{k} P[k]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">value</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0497em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1864em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>，所有分量求和。</li>\n<li><strong>合并</strong>：逐分量取最大，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>⊔</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P \\sqcup Q = (\\max(P[k], Q[k]))_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⊔</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">])</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>为什么合并是「取最大」而不是「相加」？因为每个分量记的是该副本的<strong>累计</strong>贡献，是单调上升的；同步时收到对方的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P[i]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 只可能比我手里这个旧值更新或相等，取最大即可还原最新累计值。若用相加，重复同步同一份状态就会把贡献算两遍，破坏幂等。逐分量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\max</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span></span></span></span></span> 恰好就是 <a href=\"cvrdt-semilattice\">状态 CRDT 与半格</a> 里讲的「自然数向量在逐分量 max 下的半格」，收敛免费成立。</p>\n<p>下面是一段简化实现：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"class GCounter:&#10;    def __init__(self, replica_id, n):&#10;        self.id = replica_id&#10;        self.P = [0] * n          # 每个副本的累计贡献&#10;&#10;    def increment(self):&#10;        self.P[self.id] += 1      # 只动自己的分量&#10;&#10;    def value(self):&#10;        return sum(self.P)        # 所有贡献求和&#10;&#10;    def merge(self, other):&#10;        self.P = [max(a, b) for a, b in zip(self.P, other.P)]  # 逐分量取最大\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> GCounter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, replica_id, n):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> replica_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.P </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n          </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 每个副本的累计贡献</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> increment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.P[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.id] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">      # 只动自己的分量</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> value</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> sum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.P)        </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 所有贡献求和</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> merge</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, other):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.P </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(a, b) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> a, b </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> zip</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.P, other.P)]  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 逐分量取最大</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"pn-counter-支持减法\">PN-Counter：支持减法</h2><p>只能加显然不够——点赞要能取消，库存要能扣减。但减法直接破坏了单调性：如果允许 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P[i]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 减小，状态就会回退，半格的「只升不降」假设崩塌，收敛证明失效。PN-Counter（Positive-Negative Counter）的解法干净利落：用<strong>两个</strong> G-Counter，一个记所有自增 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span>、一个记所有自减 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span>，最终值是两者之差。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>value</mtext><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>k</mi></munder><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>−</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>k</mi></munder><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{value} = \\sum_k P[k] - \\sum_k N[k]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">value</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3521em;vertical-align:-1.3021em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3021em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3521em;vertical-align:-1.3021em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3021em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>「减一」不再是让某个分量变小，而是让 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N[i]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 变大——减法被翻译成另一个方向的「加法」，单调性失而复得。这正是 <a href=\"cvrdt-semilattice\">状态 CRDT 与半格</a> 里「乘积半格」的直接应用：PN-Counter 就是两个 G-Counter 半格的乘积，合并时两个分量各自逐分量取最大。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  INC[&quot;increment()&quot;] --&gt; P[&quot;P 向量&lt;br/&gt;自增 G-Counter&quot;]&#10;  DEC[&quot;decrement()&quot;] --&gt; N[&quot;N 向量&lt;br/&gt;自减 G-Counter&quot;]&#10;  P --&gt; V[&quot;value = ΣP − ΣN&quot;]&#10;  N --&gt; V&#10;  M[&quot;merge&quot;] --&gt; MP[&quot;P 逐分量 max&quot;]&#10;  M --&gt; MN[&quot;N 逐分量 max&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n  INC[\"increment()\"] --&gt; P[\"P 向量&lt;br/&gt;自增 G-Counter\"]\n  DEC[\"decrement()\"] --&gt; N[\"N 向量&lt;br/&gt;自减 G-Counter\"]\n  P --&gt; V[\"value = ΣP − ΣN\"]\n  N --&gt; V\n  M[\"merge\"] --&gt; MP[\"P 逐分量 max\"]\n  M --&gt; MN[\"N 逐分量 max\"]</pre><h2 id=\"两种计数器对比\">两种计数器对比</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>G-Counter</th>\n<th>PN-Counter</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>支持操作</td>\n<td>仅 increment</td>\n<td>increment + decrement</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>状态</td>\n<td>一个向量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>两个向量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>值</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∑</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum P[k]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∑</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>−</mo><mo>∑</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum P[k] - \\sum N[k]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>合并</td>\n<td>逐分量 max</td>\n<td>两向量各自逐分量 max</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>半格结构</td>\n<td>向量 max 半格</td>\n<td>两个向量半格的乘积</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型用途</td>\n<td>浏览量、metrics 累加</td>\n<td>点赞/取消、库存增减</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"它解决不了的-业务不变量\">它解决不了的：业务不变量</h2><p>PN-Counter 能让所有副本对「余额是多少」达成一致，但它<strong>管不住</strong>业务约束。比如「库存不能为负」：副本 A 和副本 B 各自看到库存为 1，各自卖出一件、各自把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 加一，合并后值变成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>。CRDT 忠实地收敛到了 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>——这个结果在所有副本上一致，却违反了不变量。这呼应了 <a href=\"../foundations/why-crdts\">为什么需要 CRDT</a> 末尾的警告：CRDT 保证收敛，不保证收敛到合法状态。需要维护这类带阈值的不变量时，得借助逃逸协调（escrow）、预留额度或在关键路径上退回共识，这是 <a href=\"../practice/pitfalls-tradeoffs\">陷阱与权衡</a> 讨论的工程话题。</p>\n<p>另一个实践坑：状态向量长度等于副本数，副本动态加入/退出时需要把向量改成「副本 ID → 计数」的映射（仍是半格，见 <a href=\"../op-based/maps-registers\">映射与寄存器</a>），否则固定长度向量无法容纳新副本。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三副本并发自增的合并\">三副本并发自增的合并</h2><p>用一个三副本 G-Counter 把「逐分量取 max」为何正确演示清楚。副本编号 0、1、2，各自自增若干次后互相同步：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>时刻</th>\n<th>副本0 的 P</th>\n<th>副本1 的 P</th>\n<th>副本2 的 P</th>\n<th>全局值 ΣP</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>各自本地自增</td>\n<td>[2,0,0]</td>\n<td>[0,3,0]</td>\n<td>[0,0,1]</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>0 与 1 同步（逐分量 max）</td>\n<td>[2,3,0]</td>\n<td>[2,3,0]</td>\n<td>[0,0,1]</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>再与 2 同步</td>\n<td>[2,3,1]</td>\n<td>[2,3,1]</td>\n<td>[2,3,1]</td>\n<td>6</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>注意副本 0 和 1 第一次同步后，即便消息重复到达、或顺序颠倒，逐分量 max 都不会让任何分量重复累加——因为每个分量记的是「该副本累计自增次数」这个单调量，max 只是取最新已知值。最终三副本都收敛到 [2,3,1]，全局值恒为 6，正是各副本自增次数之和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2+3+1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>。这就是 <a href=\"cvrdt-semilattice\">状态 CRDT 与半格</a> 里「向量 max 半格」在计数器上的具体兑现。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>计数器 CRDT 的核心是「不合并结果，只合并各副本的累计贡献」，从而绕开经典丢更新。</li>\n<li>G-Counter 用每副本一个分量、查询求和、合并逐分量取 max，是向量 max 半格的实例。</li>\n<li>PN-Counter 用两个 G-Counter（加与减）相减来支持减法，把「减小」翻译成「另一向量增大」以保单调，是乘积半格的实例。</li>\n<li>CRDT 保证余额一致，但不维护「不为负」之类业务不变量；副本动态变化时需把向量换成映射。</li>\n<li>下一种、也是冲突最丰富的结构是 <a href=\"sets\">集合</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"计数器","id":"计数器"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"G-Counter：只增计数器","id":"g-counter-只增计数器"},{"level":2,"text":"PN-Counter：支持减法","id":"pn-counter-支持减法"},{"level":2,"text":"两种计数器对比","id":"两种计数器对比"},{"level":2,"text":"它解决不了的：业务不变量","id":"它解决不了的-业务不变量"},{"level":2,"text":"三副本并发自增的合并","id":"三副本并发自增的合并"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"状态 CRDT 与半格","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/crdt-conflict-free-types/state-based/cvrdt-semilattice"},"next":{"title":"集合","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/crdt-conflict-free-types/state-based/sets"}}